               respectively. The biodistribution data showed that TPGS-DOX and
               TPGS-DOX-FOL significantly lowered drug accumulation in the
               heart, thereby reducing the cardiotoxicity, which is the main
               side effect of the DOX. Furthermore, TPGS-DOX can limit, and
               TPGS-DOX-FOL can further deduce, the gastrointestinal side
               effect of the drug.",
